[{"id":"1072559","ticker":"lowest-temperature-in-hong-kong-on-september-26-2026","slug":"lowest-temperature-in-hong-kong-on-september-26-2026","title":"Lowest temperature in Hong Kong on September 26?","description":"This market will resolve to the temperature range that contains the lowest temperature recorded by the Hong Kong Observatory in degrees Celsius on 26 Sep '26.\n\nThe resolution source for this market will be information from the Hong Kong Observatory, specifically the \"Absolute Daily Min (deg. C)\" the specified date once information is finalized in the relevant \"Daily Extract\", available here: https://www.weather.gov.hk/en/cis/climat.htm\n\nIn the event that there is no data for the observation date by 11:59 PM ET on the seventh day following the observation date, this market will resolve to the lowest bracket.\n\nThis market will resolve once data for this date has been published on the resolution source, or by 11:59 PM ET on the seventh day following the observation date, whichever comes first.\n\nThe resolution source for this market measures temperatures in Celsius to one decimal place (eg, 9.1°C). Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market.\n\nAny revisions published after the Hong Kong Observatory's initial publication of data for this market's timeframe will not be considered for this market's resolution. That initial publication is the revisions cutoff.\n\nIn the case that the Resolution Source publishes data, sufficient to settle a Market, that is clearly erroneous and the result of technical or operational error, or of unauthorized interference with the Resolution Source or its data, the Market may remain open for a period of up to seven (7) calendar days (ET) from the time of the original release, in anticipation of a correction by the Resolution Source. If the Resolution Source publishes a corrected value within that period, that value will be eligible for resolution. If no corrected value is published within that period, Polymarket will issue a Clarification to determine whether the originally published value may be eligible for resolution, or whether other action is required to preserve the orderly functioning of the Market.\n\nRevisions remain subject to the cutoff above. The only exception is a correction of a clearly erroneous print under the preceding paragraph, which will be used even if published after the cutoff.","startDate":"2026-09-24T04:30:05Z","creationDate":"2026-09-24T04:32:44.517192Z","endDate":"2026-09-26T12:00:00Z","image":"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hongkong-ae9cc75f37.jpg","icon":"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hongkong-ae9cc75f37.jpg","active":true,"closed":true,"archived":false,"new":false,"featured":false,"restricted":true,"volume":47135.692253999994,"openInterest":7099.894052,"createdAt":"2026-09-24T04:29:47.59473Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-28T12:27:41.486354Z","enableOrderBook":true,"negRisk":true,"negRiskMarketID":"0xfa9d3f52475a0fe356c6c058ecf3920d1510bee08037d7ddc5ef2dca1fe40a00","commentCount":0,"markets":[{"id":"4900110","question":"Will the lowest temperature in Hong Kong be 22°C or below on September 26?","conditionId":"0xc87135335d1fbfbb9fddf0b151fa598b067b52733d3154f2f021e314e9578b4d","slug":"lowest-temperature-in-hong-kong-on-september-26-2026-22corbelow","endDate":"2026-09-26T12:00:00Z","liquidity":"0","startDate":"2026-09-24T04:30:05Z","image":"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hongkong-ae9cc75f37.jpg","icon":"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/hongkong-ae9cc75f37.jpg","description":"This market will resolve to the temperature range that contains the lowest temperature recorded by the Hong Kong Observatory in degrees Celsius on 26 Sep '26.\n\nThe resolution source for this market will be information from the Hong Kong Observatory, specifically the \"Absolute Daily Min (deg. C)\" the specified date once information is finalized in the relevant \